$NetBSD$

NetBSD portability: no memfd_create(2), no file seals, no seccomp/bwrap/caps,
no close_range(2) and no nix RLIMIT_AS. The Linux sandbox machinery is
cfg-gated; NetBSD selects the unsandboxed loader path and falls back to
POSIX shm for shared memory. A pledge(2) based sandbox is a planned
follow-up. Origin: EmberBSD (AI-assisted).

